# A whitelist, not a blocklist: this folder also holds a client's real
# certification database (dsa/certby1/certby (1).sql), personal photos and
# screen recordings. On a public repo the safe default is "nothing", and
# then name the three trees that actually get deployed.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/render.yaml
!/README.md

!/Ekstra/
Ekstra/*
!Ekstra/webserv/
!Ekstra/demo/

!/Websitem/

# The gameplay videos: 13 MB that git would carry forever, for two <video>
# blocks that are currently commented out anyway. When they come back, delete
# this line — the posters and screenshots are committed either way.
Ekstra/webserv/www/media/

# build output and runtime state: rebuilt on every deploy, never committed
Ekstra/webserv/webserv
Ekstra/webserv/*.o
Ekstra/webserv/src/*.o
Ekstra/webserv/contact.log
Ekstra/demo/logs/
Ekstra/demo/mail/
Websitem/staticfiles/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
